    "title": "Why pharma firms are going to Earth’s orbit in search of new cancer drugs",
    "summary": "Drug companies are sending experiments into low Earth orbit, where three small capsules circle about 300 miles up. Inside one, the weightlessness lets a potential cancer drug form tiny crystals that are hard to grow properly on the ground.",
